{
  "id": "ana10-c6-s1-n76",
  "card_id": "ana10-c6-s1-n76",
  "chapter": "第六章 三角函数及其图象和导数（续）",
  "section": "§ 15. 三角函数的导函数",
  "number": "76",
  "title": "余弦函数、正切函数和余切函数的导函数",
  "printed_title": "76. 余弦函数、正切函数和余切函数的导函数",
  "start_page": 10,
  "start_printed": 4,
  "figures": [
    {
      "id": "fig-02",
      "label": "图 2",
      "page": 12
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 17,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在这一小节里，我们利用正弦函数的导函数（第75小节）计算余弦函数、正切函数和余切函数的导函数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 4,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0010#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\cos' x=-\\sin x$， (1)$\\operatorname{tg}' x=\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}$， (2)$\\operatorname{ctg}' x=-\\frac{1}{\\sin^2x}$. (3)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 4,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0010#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "上列公式中的每一个式子在对应函数定义域内任何一点都成立.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 4,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0010#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了推出(1)式，我们利用等式$\\cos x=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)$和复合函数微分法则：$\\cos' x=\\left[\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)\\right]'=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)'=\\sin x(-1)=-\\sin x$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 4,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0010#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了证明(2)式和(3)式，我们利用商的导数公式和已知的正弦函数和余弦函数的导函数公式：$\\operatorname{tg}' x=\\left(\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}\\right)'=\\frac{(\\sin x)'\\cos x-(\\cos x)'\\sin x}{\\cos^2x}=\\frac{\\cos^2x+\\sin^2x}{\\cos^2x}=\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}$，$\\operatorname{ctg}' x=\\left(\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}\\right)'=\\frac{(\\cos x)'\\sin x-(\\sin x)'\\cos x}{\\sin^2x}=\\frac{-\\sin^2x-\\cos^2x}{\\sin^2x}=-\\frac{1}{\\sin^2x}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 4,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0010#10",
        "p0011#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例　求正弦曲线在横坐标 $x_1=0$，$x_2=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，$x_3=\\pi$ 三点上的切线.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0011#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "正如你们所知道的（第52小节），函数 $f$ 的图象在点$(x_0,y_0)$（这里 $y_0=f(x_0)$）的切线方程具有下面的形式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0011#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$y-y_0=f'(x_0)(x-x_0)$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0011#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在这种情况下，$f(x)=\\sin x$. 为了解题，应当求出正弦函数在点 $0$、$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 和 $\\pi$ 处的导函数值. 正弦函数的导函数等于余弦函数：$f'(0)=\\cos0=1$. 其次，我们求出",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0011#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$f'\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}=0$ 和 $f'(\\pi)=\\cos\\pi=-1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0011#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0011#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1) 在横坐标 $x_1=0$ 这一点，切线方程有 $y-0=1\\cdot(x-0)$的形式，也就是 $y=x$. 我们看到，在点 $(0,0)$ 处，正弦曲线的切线是第一象限和第三象限的平分线（图 2）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0011#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2) 在横坐标 $x_2=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 这一点，切线方程是$y-1=0\\cdot\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$，就是 $y=1$. 它是水平直线（图 2）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 5,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0011#9",
        "p0012#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "3) 类似地，在横坐标 $x_3=\\pi$ 这一点的切线方程是 $y-0=(-1)(x-\\pi)$，就是 $y=\\pi-x$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 6,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0012#2",
        "p0012#5"
      ]
    },
    {
